flowchart TB

 BACK["Backend · 2 replicas"]:::app
 CONF["ConfigMap flight-board-config<br/>+ Secret references<br/>(no secret values)"]:::ops
 MCK["MongoDB operator 1.13.0<br/>MongoDBCommunity → StatefulSet,<br/>Service, users, Secrets"]:::ops
 DB["MongoDB 8.0.32 replica set · 3 members<br/>user flightboard-app · readWrite<br/>headless Service :27017<br/>required anti-affinity · PDB min 2"]:::data
 PVC["6 PVCs · standard-rwo<br/>per member: data 5 GiB + logs 2 GiB"]:::data
 NAT["Cloud Router + Cloud NAT<br/>egress: AeroDataBox + quay.io images<br/>AUTO_ONLY IP · error-only logging"]:::ops
 AERO["AeroDataBox via RapidAPI<br/>PRG departures<br/>window now −1 h … +11 h"]:::public
 NODES["GKE nodes · container runtime<br/>pull all images · node identity fb-nodes"]:::ops
 PG["Private Google Access<br/>Google APIs + Artifact Registry"]:::ops
 AR["Artifact Registry flight-board<br/>images tagged with git SHA"]:::delivery
 LOG["Cloud Logging<br/>workload stdout (run IDs)<br/>LB request logs · NAT errors"]:::ops
 DNS["GKE control-plane DNS endpoint<br/>IAM authentication<br/>IP endpoints disabled"]:::delivery
 AUTHOR["Author<br/>gcloud / kubectl / k9s"]:::delivery
 ADMIN["Admin :8082 in backend pod<br/>127.0.0.1 only · no Service<br/>pause · resume · fetch-now"]:::ops
 CONF -.->|ConfigMap + API key + Mongo URI| BACK
 MCK -.->|generates connection-string Secret| CONF
 MCK -.->|reconciles| DB
 BACK -->|primary · majority read/write<br/>transactions: snapshot read · majority write| DB
 DB --- PVC
 BACK -->|one replica, every 30 min| NAT
 NODES -->|operator + MongoDB images from quay.io| NAT
 NODES -->|app images| PG
 NAT --> AERO
 PG -->|AR Reader · fb-nodes| AR
 BACK -.->|stdout logs| LOG
 NAT -.->|errors| LOG
 AUTHOR -->|IAM-authenticated| DNS
 DNS -.->|kubectl port-forward| ADMIN
 ADMIN -.-> BACK

